ong>B</strong> Their work is sometimes quite boring.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> The pay is not particularly good.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>13</span> 13. According to the speaker, which job is sometimes undervalued?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-13' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='13'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> Porter.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> Cleaner.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> Dishwasher.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>14</span> 14. Experience in reception may help employees:</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-14' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='14'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> to learn foreign languages.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> to manage situations successfully.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> to get a better job eventually.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; marg